{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53015","headline":"思红绡妓诗（题拟） · 崔生","name":"思红绡妓诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"误到蓬山顶上游，明璫玉女动星眸。\n朱扉半掩深宫月，应照璚芝雪艳愁。\n（见《太平广记》卷一九四引《传奇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔生","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}